WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:08.120
Here is what our photo finish looks like, the fifth day of work. There used to be a manhole here.

2
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:19.600
We repeated about 105 times that there is a manhole here, and only one of our friends fell in, my heart, the biggest in the world, our cameraman Miki.

3
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.820
And Čičko told him nicely 200 times: walk around the manhole, walk around the manhole.

4
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.160
We still have to bring in the appliances.

5
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:36.880
The guys are working at full steam, every room is being furnished, cleaning goes on in parallel, the Alfa Plam stove is being installed.

6
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:45.600
Thank God everything is going as it should, the weather is wonderful, knock on wood, and this room is being furnished properly.

7
00:00:45.600 --> 00:01:00.820
And we come to this kitchen, where my friend Aleksandar is waiting for me with a pile of boxes from Metalac, our wonderful friends.

8
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:11.240
We don't have only Metalac, we also have Sigma, so dishes, household items and a large amount of necessary things for everything.

9
00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.060
And yes, it is for the kitchen. And now we are going to start filming it with our guys.

10
00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.700
Let's start filming the Metalac sketch.

11
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:22.260
Where will you stand, where will I stand? Well, you choose.

12
00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:30.440
Will you arrange things on the stove and around the kitchen? And how did you stand, you are standing facing the kitchen.

13
00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:33.980
Come on, I'll be here. Fine.

14
00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:41.680
And tell me, please, do you want us to put something on the floor too, so we use this space as well?

15
00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.030
Well, we'll start from here. Let's go, clapperboard.

16
00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:03.090
We have reached the very end.

17
00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:07.430
Aleks, I really love the part when we arrange Sigma and Metalac.

18
00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:15.170
As people would say: why are you meddling in my part now?

19
00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:27.750
From Sigma we have coffee cups, a tea set, a set of plates and all these small things, household items for the kitchen.

20
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:36.170
We will put this here now, nicely, so that we don't waste a lot of time.

21
00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:56.560
We are finishing the house, the weather is wonderful, we are happy because we did not stay until dark, we organized well, also with taking out the rubbish. The whole street helped us enormously.

22
00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:08.340
And now the specialties: Metalac, a set of frying pans from Tefal, everything we love.

23
00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:20.360
You have the stainless steel dishes and the enamel dishes, we always have several sets of enamel and stainless steel. Fine, then you arrange things over there.

24
00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:27.100
Arrange it over here, everything. A steamer pot, a must.

25
00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.540
And sets, probably baking trays.

26
00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:37.780
Well, everything a housewife needs, and this grandma Zorka surely cooks wonderfully.

27
00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:52.700
And we had a lot of help from the street this week. All her friends, the grandmas, came and prepared savory and sweet things, fritters and doughnuts. Honestly, this week we really ate well.

28
00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:58.260
This one is for throwing away. A little more and we're done.

